        <title type="html"><![CDATA[The Security Architect's Next Deliverable: An Agentic SOC]]></title>
        <id>https://www.stream.security/post/the-security-architects-next-deliverable-an-agentic-soc</id>
        <link href="https://www.stream.security/post/the-security-architects-next-deliverable-an-agentic-soc"/>
        <updated>2026-07-27T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img alt="" loading="lazy" id="w-node-_2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63771-83c22e73" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a6741bd53c2e4f92d8794cb_An%20Agentic%20SOC-1.png" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a6741bd53c2e4f92d8794cb_An%20Agentic%20SOC-1-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a6741bd53c2e4f92d8794cb_An%20Agentic%20SOC-1-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a6741bd53c2e4f92d8794cb_An%20Agentic%20SOC-1-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6a6741bd53c2e4f92d8794cb_An%20Agentic%20SOC-1.png 1200w" class="post-image"><div class="post-content-div"><div class="div-block-992"><div class="div-block-1010"><div fs-list-field="category" class="blog-category">AI Detection &amp; Response</div><div class="highlight-tag pop w-condition-invisible">Popular</div><div class="highlight-tag w-condition-invisible">Highlights</div><div class="hide w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div fs-list-field="Topic">AI SOC</div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div fs-list-field="Topic">CDR</div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div fs-list-field="Topic">Agentic Security</div></div></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775_instance-4" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226a673db3e734bcf23a630f83%22%7D%5D" href="/post/the-security-architects-next-deliverable-an-agentic-soc" class="b-title w-inline-block"><h2 fs-list-field="title" class="heading-29 blog">The Security Architect's Next Deliverable: An Agentic SOC</h2><div class="blog-par limit-char">Security Architects are measured on how well they design defense, almost never on how well the SOC can respond to what that design misses. As AI turns the SOC from an organization into a system of agents, closing that gap becomes an architecture problem, and the Security Architect is the only one positioned to own it. Part 1 of a series building an agentic SOC hands-on with the open-source CDRGoat project.</div></a></div><div class="divider-full space small"></div><div class="div-block-773"><div class="writer-small dark"><img height="70" width="70" alt="Petr Zuzanov" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png" sizes="70px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png 1400w" class="writer-image-small"><div><div fs-list-field="author" class="writer---blog-page-home">Petr Zuzanov</div></div></div><div class="div-block-790 xs"><div class="div-block-953"><div class="writer---blog-page-home date">Jul 27, 2026</div></div><div class="code-embed-3 w-embed"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
